# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Vercel
.vercel

# OS
.DS_Store

# Live eval outputs — run_test_questions.sh truncates and rewrites these on every
# run, so they are genuinely disposable. Scoped to the exact two paths on purpose:
# do NOT broaden this to `*.log`, `*.txt` or `*.out`. The committed
# month_test_sim/baseline-*.log files are the retrieval-score baseline the whole
# verification strategy diffs against, and a wildcard here would silently eat them.
month_test_sim/test_run_log.txt
month_test_sim/test_run_summary.txt

# Secrets — every .env* is ignored EXCEPT the checked-in template.
# KEEP THIS BLOCK LAST: the negation only works if nothing re-ignores
# .env.example below it. `vercel link` appends its own `.env*` line to the
# end of this file, so if you ever re-run it, move that line above here.
.env*
!.env.example
